GsBatScepter.Desc: Reforged: every 8th bat bite splits off a phantom bat that dives at another nearby foe
GsRazorpine.Desc: Reforged: needle hits smear resin; 5 smears on one foe draw a ring of 4 needles closing in on it
GsBlizzardStaff.Desc: Reforged: every 5th icicle is a rime seed that bursts into a small frost blast where it dies
GsStaffofEarth.Desc: Reforged: the boulder grinds harder with every foe it crushes, and a half-height rock pillar erupts where it shatters
GsBetsysWrath.Desc: Reforged: every 4th cursed hit bursts into hexfire
GsNightglow.Desc: Reforged: every 5th bolt hit drops an aurora lance from above the target
GsStellarTune.Desc: Reforged: consecutive hits climb a scale; the 8th note lands as a star chord burst
GsResonanceScepter.Desc: Reforged: the royal wave rings a standing wave pulse on every 3rd foe it pierces
GsNebulaArcanum.Desc: Reforged: the arcanum orb itself now swells in flight and slowly drags lesser foes toward its heart
GsNebulaBlaze.Desc: Reforged: nebula eruption bolts now always ignite a micro nova where they strike
GsLunarFlare.Desc: Reforged: every 4th cast pours a pale fourth flare from the sky
